===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|turteltūbe}}, {{m|gmh|türteltūbe}}, from {{inh|de|goh|turtulatūba}}, {{m|goh|turtultūba}}, {{m|goh|turtiltūba}}, from {{der|de|ML.|tortella}}, {{m|la|turtella}} (two [[Middle Latin]] [[diminutive]] forms), from {{der|de|la|turtur}} (an [[onomatopoeic]] word imitative of the dove’s call, i.e., its [[coo]] or [[cooing]]).

